        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Russell Estate Agents are delighted to present this rare opportunity to acquire a spacious and impeccably designed home in a sought-after enclave close to the villages of Blackrock & Stillorgan.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2019, this exceptional property is presented in immaculate condition and offers beautifully proportioned, light-filled accommodation throughout. The thoughtfully designed layout comprises three generous double bedrooms, including two with ensuite bathrooms, alongside an impressive ground floor offering extensive living and entertaining space.\r\n\r\nDesigned with meticulous attention to detail, the home features well-proportioned rooms, excellent storage, a bright, naturally lit kitchen, spacious bedrooms and high-quality finishes throughout. Underfloor heating further enhances the comfort and efficiency of this outstanding home.\r\n\r\nBuilt with environmental sustainability at its core, the property boasts an excellent A energy rating, making it both environmentally conscious and highly cost-efficient to run.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive, with the villages of Stillorgan and Blackrock within easy walking distance. Both offer an excellent selection of shops, restaurants, cafés and everyday conveniences, along with a wide range of grocery and retail options.\r\n\r\nThe property is also ideally positioned for families, being approximately a 10-minute drive from Nord Anglia International School Dublin, while Dublin Airport is easily accessible via the Port Tunnel.\r\n\r\nCombining contemporary design, energy efficiency, generous accommodation and an exceptional location, this is a truly outstanding home offering modern living at its finest."
